      "filename": "Beatles and George Martin in studio 1966.JPG",
      "title": "File:Beatles and George Martin in studio 1966.JPG",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7c/Beatles_and_George_Martin_in_studio_1966.JPG",
